Starting from +0, you have a non-trivial chance of detonating the ring
before you get to +5 or more.  Each blessed scroll of charging adds 1d3
to the spe of the ring; if the ring's spe before a charging attempt is
greater than a random integer from 0 to 6, it detonates, doing 3 * spe
damage to you.

(You have about a 33% chance of getting +5 or higher in two rolls, with
either a 28% or 42% chance of detonating the ring.)
